18:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-01-13T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-01-09T18:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-01-10T01:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"399\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-clapham-grand-zl9b\",\"profile_active\":false},\"unicorn\":false,\"date_unix\":1767983400,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"impression_id\":\"f6ea7974d6589a14:0\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"secondary_status\":\"rescheduled\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1061\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"address\":\"The Clapham Grand, 21-25 St John's Hill, London SW11 1TT, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4629923,\"lng\":-0.169368800000029},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2024-06-05/35fd37f7-73c6-4d16-a3a1-47ab54898234.jpg?rect=359%2C0%2C1334%2C1334\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-clapham-grand-ry8v\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://claphamgrand.com/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-01-09T18:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"previews\":[],\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/If5f561a2b64?dice_id=If5f561a2b64\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ta2cb9da3d39?dice_id=Ta2cb9da3d39\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/bd180f2ecff3?dice_id=bd180f2ecff3\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/K362fa5e3825?dice_id=K362fa5e3825\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ce20343b63ff?dice_id=ce20343b63ff\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/f0dcef8fa310?dice_id=f0dcef8fa310\"},\"max_tickets\":12,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"id\":\"678512f91583a20001ccc867\",\"public_refund_policy\":null,\"name\":\"Labyrinth Movie Night and A Bowie Disco!\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Join our fabulous, annual, Labyrinth Movie Night on Fri 9th January 2026!**\\n\\n**DOORS: 6:30PM**  \\n**SHOW: 7:30PM**  \\n**MOVIE: 8PM**  \\n**MOVIE \\u0026 SHOW END: 10pmPM**  \\n**BOWIE DISCO: 10PM-CLOSE**  \\n**CURFEW: 1AM**\\n\\nCome join us, Jareth, Hoggle, Ludo, Sarah \\u0026 the gang deep inside Jim Henson cult classic Labyrinth on our MASSIVE SCREEN alongside all our Movie Night magic 🎬 ...\\\"You remind me of the babe……” 🔮\\n\\nWe’ll be bringing back our world famous Dance Magic Dance-Off, there’s prizes for the best fancy dress in the Goblin King Costume Parade, free Star Man make up Make Overs, Themed Cocktails (bog of eternal stench fish bowl anyone...)\\n\\nAnd new for this year: We'll be finishing with a bigger and better than ever before BOWIE DISCO! Join us after the movie for all your fave Bowie classics other 70s \\u0026 80s bangers! What better way to celebrate what would be the great man’s Birthday Weekend! 🎂\\n\\nExpect:\\n\\n- Movie on our massive 25ft screen 📺\\n- Our Dreamteam show hosts and dancers ⚡️\\n- Dance magic dance-offs 💃\\n- A Bowie Disco from 10pm-1am!\\n- Goblin King costume comp 🥇\\n- The Grand’s themed cocktails 🍹\\n- Hotdogs \\u0026 nachos courtesy of Hot Beige (Vegan goodness, too) 🌭\\n- Popcorn for £3 🍿\\n\\nOur Movie Nights are like no other, alongside watching Labyrinth uninterrupted on our massive (25 ft!) HD Screen, we have a whole lot more in store for you before \\u0026 after the film, including The Grand’s Dreamteam hosts \\u0026 show team, all the confetti, games and even the occasional balloon drop. 🎈\\n\\nFeel free to sing-along, heckle the bad guys and cheer for your heroes, a costume is never un-appreciated (in fact we often give out prizes for the best or worst), the bar \\u0026 food stalls stay open during the movie and sometimes afterwards there’s a club night to top things off!\\n\\n**Super Important Movie Night Deets:**\\n\\n**TICKETS 🎟**\\n\\nFor any ticketing queries please contact http://dice.fm/contact\\n\\n**AGE RESTRICTIONS 😉**\\n\\nWe are afraid our Movie Nights are for over 18’s, the films might be suitable for kids, but our show teams humour might not be!\\n\\n**TIMES ⏰**\\n\\nDoors at 6:30pm and the fun starts about 7.30pm, we advise arrival before 7pm so give you time to be seated by our ushers and grab food and drink from the bars. The movie will start around 8pm, and there is a cheeky Bowie disco until about 12am.\\n\\n**SEATING 🪑**\\n\\nStalls \\u0026 Circle seating is unreserved and allocated on a first come first served basis across these areas. Upper Circle seating is allocated first come first served basis across this area. There are as many seats as there are tickets sold so please don’t panic about getting one\\n\\n**ROYAL BOXES \\u0026 TABLES 👑**\\n\\nRoyal Boxes \\u0026 Tables will be reserved for you, and we hold them all until an hour after doors open. Please notify us in advance if you’re running late as we will offer to other customers once the movie starts.\\n\\n**SUBTITLES 👀**\\n\\nWe aim to make our Movie Nights an enjoyable experience for everyone, and will show our Movie’s with subtitles on if requested by any hard of hearing customers, please email us if this is required info@claphamgrand.com\\n\\n**ACCESSIBILITY TICKETS 📧**\\n\\nFor any accessibility requirements or tickets, please contact info@claphamgrand.com, where you shall receive a code to access and pay for your tickets. (availability depending)\\n\\n**VENUE ACCESSIBILITY ♿️**\\n\\nFor any accessibility assistance coming to our venue, please don’t hesitate to contact us in advance so we can make sure we can facilitate this: info@claphamgrand.com. We have a fully wheelchair accessible toilet, located in our gender neutral bathroom in the stalls, and we have step free access into the stalls.\\n\\n**CLOAKROOM 🧥**\\n\\nWe have a cloakroom here, which was voted in the top 5 cloakrooms in the UK for the last 10 years, and it’s £2.50 an item.\\n\\n**PARKING / GETTING HERE 🚂 🚗 🚌**\\n\\nWe don’t have any parking at venue (these Victorians only had horses and carts), but we are directly opposite Clapham Junction, (Europes busiest train station!) and there are parking spaces available there from www.justpark.com and we are on so many bus routes!\\n\\n**FAQ'S ❓**\\n\\nFor any other questions, please refer to FAQ page – https://claphamgrand.com/faqs\\n\\n**SPECIAL EFFECTS WARNING 🎉 🎈🚥 ⚠️**\\n\\nPlease note there will be strobes, flashing lights, loud noises, confetti, the occasional balloon drop and other fun stuff used in the venue. If you have any concerns about this don’t hesitate to contact us via info@claphamgrand.com – we want to make sure you have a safe experience with us!\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"new\":false,\"donation\":null,\"perm_name\":\"eodx2w-labyrinth-movie-night-and-a-bowie-disco-9th-jan-the-clapham-grand-london-tickets\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"event_tag\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"film\",\"value\":\"culture:film\",\"title\":\"Film\"}]},{\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Deeper Into Movies.\",\"properties\":[],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1200,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"marketeers\":[],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-28/af1181bc-bb8c-4783-aab2-8fc09be0c1b8.jpg?rect=412%2C0%2C1065%2C1065\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-28/af1181bc-bb8c-4783-aab2-8fc09be0c1b8.jpg?rect=57%2C0%2C1775%2C1065\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-28/af1181bc-bb8c-4783-aab2-8fc09be0c1b8.jpg?rect=651%2C0%2C586%2C1065\"},\"announcement_date_unix\":1766846700,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-27T14:45:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-01-11T14:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-27T14:45:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-01-11T14:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-01-11T15:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1357\",\"name\":\"Deeper Into Movies\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"deeper-into-movies-pgep\",\"profile_active\":true},\"unicorn\":true,\"date_unix\":1768140000,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"impression_id\":\"f6ea7974d6589a14:1\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"secondary_status\":\"waiting-list\",\"streaming_options\":null,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"2338\",\"name\":\"The Haggerston\",\"address\":\"438 Kingsland Rd, London E8 4AA, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5423183,\"lng\":-0.0758063000000675},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-haggerston-29wp\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":false,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-01-11T14:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"previews\":[],\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ec5d0728523e?dice_id=ec5d0728523e\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Mb1ea61a2870?dice_id=Mb1ea61a2870\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R0f409a6eaa4?dice_id=R0f409a6eaa4\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Na67cd3c779c?dice_id=Na67cd3c779c\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/mb035e854628?dice_id=mb035e854628\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ufc367d243f3?dice_id=Ufc367d243f3\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"id\":\"694ff0ea8ef9560001b7484a\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"name\":\"WE ARE MAKING A FILM ABOUT MARK FISHER \",\"about\":{\"description\":\"We Are Making A Film About Mark Fisher — a 65-minute cinematic experiment exploring the continuing relevance of the late theorist’s ideas on capitalism, culture, and the future.\\n\\nBlending documentary, performance, and hauntological fiction, the film follows Parkins — a time-slipped character — through ghostly landscapes and digital spaces, tracing Fisher’s thought from the 1990s to our algorithmic present.\\n\\nCreated collaboratively by over 70 artists through Instagram (@markfisherfilm), the film embodies Fisher’s call for collective imagination beyond capitalist realism.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"new\":false,\"donation\":null,\"perm_name\":\"k6a6rp-we-are-making-a-film-about-mark-fisher-11th-jan-the-haggerston-london-tickets\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"event_tag\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"film\",\"value\":\"culture:film\",\"title\":\"Film\"}]},{\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Deeper Into Movies.\",\"properties\":[],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1200,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"mar