fm/J6a6e95c86b6?dice_id=J6a6e95c86b6\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Cdb92bb74f8c?dice_id=Cdb92bb74f8c\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/z2bf28897657?dice_id=z2bf28897657\"},\"max_tickets\":12,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"id\":\"68c9359bce06170001f66fa7\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"name\":\"High School Musical Movie 3 Bottomless Brunch Party!\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"**Enjoy High School Musical 3 as we bring this cult classic back for one day only, on Sat 17th January 2026 🌟**\\n\\nThey went viral on TikTok last year and over 4,500 Disney Channel lovers have already come to party with us before… So, gather your fellow Wild Cats for:\\n\\nAn hour of bottomless booze 🍾  \\nThe whole movie on our big-ass screen! 📽️  \\nWe’re All In This Together mass sing-a-longs🎙️  \\nDisney Channel Mini Disco 🕺  \\nShow stopping performances from our Wild Cat Dreamteam 🤩  \\nPrizes for the Best Costumes 👗  \\nGet’cha Head in the Game Competition 🏆  \\nHotdogs \\u0026 Nachos courtesy of Hot Beige, even vegan goodness too! 🌭  \\nPopcorn for £3 🍿\\n\\n**IMPORTANT INFO:**\\n\\nDoors: 12PM  \\nBottomless hour: 12:30-1:30PM  \\nMovie, Show, Games: 1-3:30PM  \\nMini Disney Disco: until close at 4:15PM  \\nLast Entry 1pm\\n\\nFor any ticketing or accessibility assistance, please email info@claphamgrand.com detailing your enquiry and the show/date in question and we’ll be happy to help!\\n\\nFor any accessibility requests, please contact access@claphamgrand.com or call us on 020 7223 6523 to discuss how we can best support you.\\n\\nFor any other questions, please contact us on info@claphamgrand.com or visit our FAQ page.\\n\\nAge restrictions for shows with us vary on an event by event basis. Please check the event description and if in doubt email us on info@claphamgrand.com.\\n\\nPlease note there may be strobes, flashing lights, loud noises, confetti, the occasional balloon drop and other fun stuff used in the venue. If you have any concerns about this don’t hesitate to contact us if you need any further assistance, we want to make sure you have a safe and enjoyable experience with us!\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"new\":false,\"donation\":null,\"perm_name\":\"k6orqo-high-school-musical-movie-3-bottomless-brunch-party-17th-jan-the-clapham-grand-london-tickets\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"event_tag\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"film\",\"value\":\"culture:film\",\"title\":\"Film\"}]},{\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Deeper Into Movies.\",\"properties\":[],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1000,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"marketeers\":[],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-01-20/f27397e5-991c-4370-a676-3f0cccd27355.jpg?rect=150%2C0%2C900%2C900\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-01-20/f27397e5-991c-4370-a676-3f0cccd27355.jpg?rect=0%2C90%2C1200%2C720\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-01-20/f27397e5-991c-4370-a676-3f0cccd27355.jpg?rect=353%2C0%2C495%2C900\"},\"announcement_date_unix\":1766846700,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-27T14:45:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-01-17T14:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-27T14:45:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-01-17T14:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-01-17T16:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"1357\",\"name\":\"Deeper Into Movies\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"deeper-into-movies-pgep\",\"profile_active\":true},\"unicorn\":true,\"date_unix\":176