l works to his later digital curiosities, this event celebrates Lynch’s unrelenting creativity and boundary-pushing vision.\\n\\nDelve deeper into the labyrinthine psyche of surrealist nightmare-weaver David Lynch with these unsettling, hallucinatory shorts that reflect the origins and evolution of his singular style. Spanning the early experimental and painterly works that laid the foundation for his cult sensation ERASERHEAD through his darkly absurdist experiments. these films are replete with the sinister, uncanny imagery that could have emerged only from an artist so deeply in tune with his subconscious...including David interogating a talking monkey.\\n\\nTICKET SALES GO TO THE DAVID LYNCH FOUNDATION\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"new\":false,\"donation\":null,\"perm_name\":\"av3vmx-david-lynch-short-film-marathon-17th-jan-the-haggerston-london-tickets\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[{\"name\":\"Film Screening\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2020-09-15/0b8ef9ab-63ad-41fd-bec4-98e25f9bca16.jpg?rect=67%2C0%2C798%2C798\"},\"artist_id\":\"11393\",\"about\":null,\"is_headliner\":false}],\"total_artists\":1,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"score\":0,\"event_tag\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"film\",\"value\":\"culture:film\",\"title\":\"Film\"}]},{\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The BRIT School Limited.\",\"properties\":[],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":412},\"marketeers\":[],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-18/94c5f67e-72df-40a4-a0db-415edeb448f9.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1000%2C1000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-18/94c5f67e-72df-40a4-a0db-415edeb448f9.jpg?rect=0%2C200%2C1000%2C600\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-18/