f?dice_id=Y85844a5873f\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/yb7cc8ca8c72?dice_id=yb7cc8ca8c72\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/n234260b4cb6?dice_id=n234260b4cb6\"},\"max_tickets\":6,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"id\":\"695d1ab06dab5a0001855b98\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"name\":\"WE ARE MAKING A FILM ABOUT MARK FISHER \",\"about\":{\"description\":\"We Are Making A Film About Mark Fisher — a 65-minute cinematic experiment exploring the continuing relevance of the late theorist’s ideas on capitalism, culture, and the future.\\n\\nBlending documentary, performance, and hauntological fiction, the film follows Parkins — a time-slipped character — through ghostly landscapes and digital spaces, tracing Fisher’s thought from the 1990s to our algorithmic present.\\n\\nCreated collaboratively by over 70 artists through Instagram (@markfisherfilm), the film embodies Fisher’s call for collective imagination beyond capitalist realism.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"new\":false,\"donation\":null,\"perm_name\":\"g5dpqp-we-are-making-a-film-about-mark-fisher-26th-jan-the-ivy-house-london-tickets\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"score\":0,\"event_tag\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"film\",\"value\":\"culture:film\",\"title\":\"Film\"}]},{\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Deeper Into Movies.\",\"properties\":[\"selling_fast\"],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1200,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"marketeers\":[],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-28/af1181bc-bb8c-4783-aab2-8fc09be0c1b8.jpg?rect=412%2C0%2C1065%2C1065\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-28/af1181bc-bb8c-4783-aab2-8fc09be0c1b8.jpg?re