ll\",\"preview_url\":\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/3a/14/67/3a1467db-a3fe-9c11-238b-aea2f186a471/mzaf_11450236995038389667.plus.aac.p.m4a\",\"track_name\":\"Rebel Girl\"}],\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Eaf15beb3776?dice_id=Eaf15beb3776\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ac45c3bbe5eb?dice_id=ac45c3bbe5eb\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/f84911317be7?dice_id=f84911317be7\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/N07685db3095?dice_id=N07685db3095\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/i44a79a6181a?dice_id=i44a79a6181a\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/md6339e04493?dice_id=md6339e04493\"},\"max_tickets\":10,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"id\":\"68dfdeebb5dbc6000198bbb9\",\"public_refund_policy\":null,\"name\":\"SHE-1 2026\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"On Friday January 9th, EVE presents the 2026 SHE-1 Quarter and Semi-Finals all in one night!\\n\\nHosted by award winning comedian SIKISA \\\\[star of Live At The Apollo, Comedy Central, Jonathan Ross' Comedy Club, and more\\\\], join us for the spectacular, immersive, live action stunt filled world of women's pro-wrestling mixed with award winning neo-burlesque stars, comedy, and more!\\n\\nYou bring yourself and we'll bring our critically acclaimed, uniquely chaotic, punk-rock, immersive, action packed show for a night out you'll never forget!\\n\\nEVE is produced by the western-world's longest running promoters of this genre, Emily \\u0026 Dann Read, alongside AEW Star Will Ospreay.\\n\\nDon't just take our word for it - check out what others had to say:\\n\\n\\\"I had one of the funniest, most uplifting nights ever at EVE!\\\" - Kathy Burke, Actor, Comedian and Producer\\n\\n\\\"I brought my sisters and a few friends and we had such an amazing time. Everyone should get to know EVE!” - Netflix GLOW Star \\u0026 Musician Kate Nash\\n\\n“A clear message of empowerment...And inclusivity” - Red Bulletin\\n\\n“Their athleticism is captivating...I’m in awe!” Women’s Health\\n\\nPlease note this is an 18+ event - no one under the age of 18 can attend this event, accompanied or otherwise. For full terms and conditions and event policies please go to: www.evewrestling.com/policies\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"new\":false,\"donation\":null,\"perm_name\":\"eoa9mo-she-1-2026-9th-jan-big-penny-social-london-tickets\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"score\":0,\"event_tag\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"theatre\",\"value\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}]},{\"presented_by\":\"Presented by House of Burlesque.\",\"properties\":[],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":2035},\"marketeers\":[],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-07-19/042cc3b1-9ac8-4947-8f09-722659ba176a.jpg?rect=0%2C250%2C1001%2C1001\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-07-19/042cc3b1-9ac8-4947-8f09-722659ba176a.jpg?rect=0%2C450%2C1001%2C601\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-07-19/042cc3b1-9ac8-4947-8f09-722659ba176a.jpg?rect=88%2C0%2C825%2C1500\"},\"announcement_date_unix\":1764349200,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-11-28T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-01-10T15:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-11-29T11:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-01-10T18:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-01-10T22:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2924\",\"name\":\"House of Burlesque\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"house-of-burlesque-6pd8\",\"profile_active\":false},\"unicorn\":true,\"date_unix\":1768068000,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"impression_id\":\"36a2bd84eebc2f97:1\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"15810\",\"name\":\"QT\",\"address\":\"66 Great Queen Street, Camden, London, WC2B 5BX, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.51584,\"lng\":-0.12026},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"qt-8ea25\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-01-10T18:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"previews\":[],\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ff2a263e6e0d?dice_id=ff2a263e6e0d\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/j8a31d3f2c98?dice_id=j8a31d3f2c98\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/zb053d91d2b9?dice_id=zb053d91d2b9\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F2b47b4bed85?dice_id=F2b47b4bed85\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/V209a9adcfff?dice_id=V209a9adcfff\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r8d9fc0670be?dice_id=r8d9fc0670be\"},\"max_tickets\":100,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"id\":\"6931736091b7be0001380116\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"name\":\"House of Burlesque Speakeasy \",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Under the streets of the world famous London's West End lurks a world of stockings, feathers and fabulousness. The UK's TOP Burlesque production house's weekly Saturday night residency, started at the legendary Madame Jojo's, is here and is the perfect start to the party! Venture under the streets of London to spend some time with 'Burlesque Queen' (What's on Stage) Miss Tempest Rose and the stars of The House of Burlesque…\\n\\nSee Burlesque dancing divas, tantalising tassel-twirlers, and cabaret glitterati with everything in between in an uplifting fabulous live show performed in the round. This special early show is the perfect prelude to dinner and a night on the town if you are heading out after, or all guests are welcome to stay on after the show to dance the night away at the venue. Arrive early doors to enjoy special Happy Hour, DJ afterparty till late.\\n\\n\\\\*Please note all tickets are non-refundable\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"new\":false,\"donation\":null,\"perm_name\":\"8erxe2-house-of-burlesque-speakeasy-10th-jan-qt-london-tickets\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"score\":0,\"event_tag\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"theatre\",\"value\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}]},{\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Entertainment Providers.\",\"properties\":[],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2266,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":13,\"name\":\"Scala\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://scala.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-02/3969c266-6cc1-4d75-acd8-5c24424bc2d1.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C4219%2C4219\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-02/3969c266-6cc1-4d75-acd8-5c24424bc2d1.jpg?rect=0%2C844%2C4219%2C2531\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-02/3969c266-6cc1-4d75-acd8-5c24424bc2d1.jpg?rect=950%2C0%2C2320%2C4219\"},\"announcement_date_unix\":1747832400,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-05-21T14:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-01-10T17:15:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-05-21T14:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-01-10T18:15:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-01-10T21:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2066\",\"name\":\"Scala\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"scala-9b69\",\"profile_active\":false},\"unicorn\":false,\"date_unix\":1768068900,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"impression_id\":\"36a2bd84eebc2f97:2\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"78\",\"name\":\"Scala\",\"address\":\"Scala, 275 Pentonville Rd, London N1 9NL, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5308033,\"lng\":-0.12080590000005031},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-02-10/84c4e891-e02c-45c6-8678-bf48caad44d9.jpg?rect=1000%2C0%2C4000%2C4000\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"scala-j55d\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://scala.co.uk/admission/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-01-10T18:15:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-01-10T21:30:00+00:00\"}],\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"previews\":[],\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Gffe9fc5a4c2?dice_id=Gffe9fc5a4c2\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/l8a1da866d24?dice_id=l8a1da866d24\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R144fbf44ed5?dice_id=R144fbf44ed5\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/g1046d9c1388?dice_id=g1046d9c1388\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Leb319bc8fef?dice_id=Leb319bc8fef\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/lda9e7a4673e?dice_id=lda9e7a4673e\"},\"max_tickets\":21,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"id\":\"682dcb90420e6e0001e08918\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"name\":\"SINDERELLA - London’s Naughtiest Adult Pantomime\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"PLEASE NOTE THIS IS A SEATED EVENT AND NOT A STANDING EVENT\\n\\nTHE SEATING IS NOT NUMBERED HOWEVER WE CAN RESERVE YOUR SEATS OF YOUR CHOICE BY EMAILING THE SHOWS PRODUCERS info@theentertainmentproviders.co.uk\\n\\nADULT PANTOMIME IS BACK IN THE WEST END WITH SINDERELLA - LONDONS NAUGHTIEST ADULTS ONLY PANTO!!!\\n\\nThe Entertainment Providers the team that brought last year’s sell out show Sinderella are back for 2025 with a brand-new production of Sinderella at the prestigious Scala in the heart of London’s West End, for a limited run from 19th December - 11th January\\n\\nGet ready for raucous laughter, innuendos, outwinds and unexpected encounters that will have you begging for more!\\n\\nJoin Cinderella , Prince Donkey Dick , Buttons and the two Ugly Slappers for a night of pantomime frolics and more!!!\\n\\nSinderella has no money, no man and none of the glamorous life she claims to be living. Until one day, she meets Prince Donkey Dick in the woods who invites her to his ball …. But who has the biggest balls? Will this be her happy ending or will she lose more than her shoe?\\n\\nThis pop powered pantomime features feel good party anthems Dancing Queen, Electric Dreams, Its Raining Men Like A Virgin, Never Going To Give You Up and more. With an utterly filthy laugh a minute script and a whole load of audience participation this is the perfect way to kick start your Christmas with a bang!!!\\n\\nSimon Gross producer says “Sinderella “takes all the ingredients of the pantomimes we grew up with and know and love but takes the double entendre to the next level! All the bits that were knowingly laughed at by your Dad are exposed in all their glory in a fairy tale romp. This year we’re really looking forward to pushing the boundaries to bring you the most memorable and hilarious night out on the heart of London” -\\n\\nJane Cotter Marketing Manager for Scala says, “We are super excited for this opportunity to house London’s number one adult pantomime, which is also perfectly in line with our new vision of the venue creating music comedy, theatre and entertainment for all.. It’s a show not to miss!”\\n\\nCritical acclaim for 2025 show Snow White\\n\\n\\\"A superb, fun night out we’ve all been craving for\\\" London Theatre\\n\\n\\\"A fantastic modern twist on a pantomime classic. a rip-roaring night to remember!\\\" Mirror Online\\n\\n\\\"Loved it! Panto at its best - full of fun frivolity and raunchiness” - Daily Star\\n\\n\\\"You need to see it, to believe it...This is pure madness...very funny and highly entertaining\\\" West End Extra\\n\\n\\\"Totally degenerate, twisted, camp hilarity from beginning to end. Why do we have to wait a year to see the next one!\\\" - The Audience Club\\n\\nThe show this year will be raising money for The Terrence Higgins Trust fighting HIV And Aids.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"new\":false,\"donation\":null,\"perm_name\":\"avdgm2-sinderella-londons-naughtiest-adult-pantomime-10th-jan-scala-london-tickets\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"score\":0,\"event_tag\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"theatre\",\"value\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}]},{\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The Entertainment Providers.\",\"properties\":[],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2266,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":13,\"name\":\"Scala\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://scala.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":null,\"ga_tracking_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-02/ce9cddf2-f88b-4386-81bc-34bca4362943.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C4219%2C4219\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-02/ce9cddf2-f88b-4386-81bc-34bca4362943.jpg?rect=0%2C844%2C4219%2C2531\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-09-02/ce9cddf2-f88b-4386-81bc-34bca4362943.jpg?rect=950%2C0%2C2320%2C4219\"},\"announcement_date_unix\":1747832400,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-05-21T14:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-01-11T12:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-05-21T14:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-01-11T13:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-01-11T16:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"2066\",\"name\":\"Scala\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"scala-9b69\",\"profile_active\":false},\"unicorn\":false,\"date_unix\":1768136400,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":false,\"offers_extras\":false,\"impression_id\":\"36a2bd84eebc2f97:3\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"78\",\"name\":\"Scala\",\"address\":\"Scala, 275 Pentonville Rd, London N1 9NL, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5308033,\"lng\":-0.12080590000005031},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-02-10/84c4e891-e02c-45c6-8678-bf48caad44d9.jpg?rect=1000%2C0%2C4000%2C4000\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"scala-j55d\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"http://scala.co.uk/admission/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-01-11T13:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":\"2026-01-11T16:30:00+00:00\"}],\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"previews\":[],\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/F5837e3e0bdb?dice_id=F5837e3e0bdb\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o31f2fd3972e?dice_id=o31f2fd3972e\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o50c5e73b140?dice_id=o50c5e73b140\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/g9d72f44a3b7?dice_id=g9d72f44a3b7\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/S946cca2fca1?dice_id=S946cca2fca1\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Aba8568edb57?dice_id=Aba8568edb57\"},\"max_tickets\":20,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"id\":\"682dd47ef6e47d00012a1852\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"name\":\"SINDERELLA - London’s Naughtiest Adult Pantomime\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"PLEASE NOTE THIS IS A SEATED EVENT AND NOT A STANDING EVENT\\n\\nTHE SEATING IS NOT NUMBERED HOWEVER WE CAN RESERVE YOUR SEATS OF YOUR CHOICE BY EMAILING THE SHOWS PRODUCERS info@theentertainmentproviders.co.uk\\n\\nADULT PANTOMIME IS BACK IN THE WEST END WITH SINDERELLA - LONDONS NAUGHTIEST ADULTS ONLY PANTO!!!\\n\\nThe Entertainment Providers the team that brought last year’s sell out show Sinderella are back for 2025 with a brand-new production of Sinderella at the prestigious Scala in the heart of London’s West End, for a limited run from 19th December - 11th January\\n\\nGet ready for raucous laughter, innuendos, outwinds and unexpected encounters that will have you begging for more!\\n\\nJoin Cinderella , Prince Donkey Dick , Buttons and the two Ugly Slappers for a night of pantomime frolics and more!!!\\n\\nSinderella has no money, no man and none of the glamorous life she claims to be living. Until one day, she meets Prince Donkey Dick in the woods who invites her to his ball …. But who has the biggest balls? Will this be her happy ending or will she lose more than her shoe?\\n\\nThis pop powered pantomime features feel good party anthems Dancing Queen, Electric Dreams, Its Raining Men Like A Virgin, Never Going To Give You Up and more. With an utterly filthy laugh a minute script and a whole load of audience participation this is the perfect way to kick start your Christmas with a bang!!!\\n\\nSimon Gross producer says “Sinderella “takes all the ingredients of the pantomimes we grew up with and know and love but takes the double entendre to the next level! All the bits that were knowingly laughed at by your Dad are exposed in all their glory in a fairy tale romp. This year we’re really looking forward to pushing the boundaries to bring you the most memorable and hilarious night out on the heart of London” -\\n\\nJane Cotter Marketing Manager for Scala says, “We are super excited for this opportunity to house London’s number one adult pantomime, which is also perfectly in line with our new vision of the venue creating music comedy, theatre and entertainment for all.. It’s a show not to miss!”\\n\\nCritical acclaim for 2025 show Snow White\\n\\n\\\"A superb, fun night out we’ve all been craving for\\\" London Theatre\\n\\n\\\"A fantastic modern twist on a pantomime classic. a rip-roaring night to remember!\\\" Mirror Online\\n\\n\\\"Loved it! Panto at its best - full of fun frivolity and raunchiness” - Daily Star\\n\\n\\\"You need to see it, to believe it...This is pure madness...very funny and highly entertaining\\\" West End Extra\\n\\n\\\"Totally degenerate, twisted, camp hilarity from beginning to end. Why do we have to wait a year to see the next one!\\\" - The Audience Club\\n\\nThe show this year will be raising money for The Terrence Higgins Trust fighting HIV And Aids.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"new\":false,\"donation\":null,\"perm_name\":\"l86rrl-sinderella-londons-naughtiest-adult-pantomime-11th-jan-scala-london-tickets\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"score\":0,\"event_tag\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"theatre\",\"value\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}]},{\"presented_by\":\"Presented by House of Burlesque.\",\"properties\":[],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":2035},\"marketeers\":[],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-07-19/042cc3b1-9ac8-4947-8f09-722659ba176a.jpg?rect=0%2C250%2C1001%2C1001\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-07-19/042cc3b1-9ac8-4947-8f09-722659ba176a.jpg?rect=0%2C450%2C1001%2C601\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2023-07-19/042cc3b1-9ac8-4947-8f09-722659ba176a.jpg?rect=88%2C0%2C825%2C1500\"},\"announcement_dat