She stabbed a man.\\n\\nShe used a hammer.\\n\\nShe had a baby.\\n\\nShe can't find her mother.\\n\\nShe's covered in blood and doesn't know why.\\n\\nAlice Birch’s heartbreaking play reaches across society to explore the impact of the criminal justice system on women and their families.\\n\\nAge guidance 15+\\n\\nContent warning:\\n\\nContains flashing lights, haze, blood, strong language, sexual content, drug use, theatrical weapons, and themes of violence, abuse, self-harm, suicide, and death (including of children).\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 15+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"new\":false,\"donation\":null,\"perm_name\":\"3onbol-blank-by-alice-birch-3rd-feb-the-brit-theatre-the-brit-school-london-tickets\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"score\":0,\"event_tag\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"theatre\",\"value\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}]},{\"presented_by\":\"Presented by The BRIT School Limited.\",\"properties\":[],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":824},\"marketeers\":[],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-17/1fbb298b-82c5-4f1f-bb91-539cb149e7e0.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-17/1fbb298b-82c5-4f1f-bb91-539cb149e7e0.jpg?rect=0%2C240%2C1200%2C720\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-12-17/1fbb298b-82c5-4f1f-bb91-539cb149e7e0.jpg?rect=270%2C0%2C660%2C1200\"},\"announcement_date_unix\":1765973700,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"faqs\":[{\"id\":65009,\"title\":\"How to get here?\",\"body\":\"If travelling by car, please use SE25 5PL for Sat Nav, as our shared car parking entrance is in Dagnall Park. You will need to enter your registration plate at Reception to avoid a parking charge.\\n\\nThe Crescent is part of Croydon's Healthy Schools Scheme. This means that you can no longer drive a vehicle into The Crescent from 08.00am – 9.30am and 2.00pm – 4.00pm.\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":65010,\"title\":\"What is a Concession\",\"body\":\"A concession price is available for a child, student at any school, college or university or an OAP.\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":65011,\"title\":\"How do I book an access ticket?\",\"body\":\"Please contact tickets@brit.school before making your booking\",\"order\":2}],\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-12-17T12:15:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-05T17:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-12-19T12:00:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-05T16:30:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-05T18:45:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"5585\",\"name\":\"The BRIT School Limited\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-brit-school-limited-r59q\",\"profile_active\":true},\"unicorn\":true,\"date_unix\":1770309000,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"impression_id\":\"36a2bd84eebc2f97:19\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"5662\",\"name\":\"The BRIT Theatre -  The BRIT School\",\"address\":\"60 The Crescent, Croydon CR0 2HN, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.3900037,\"lng\":-0.0914101},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-brit-theatre----the-brit-school-2gya\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-05T16:15:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"previews\":[],\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/i930974abebc?dice_id=i930974abebc\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z7829a619ba4?dice_id=Z7829a619ba4\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Z3635a627782?dice_id=Z3635a627782\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Ra62d738b5e6?dice_id=Ra62d738b5e6\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/l38233e653d3?dice_id=l38233e653d3\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o5b50c7c1a02?dice_id=o5b50c7c1a02\"},\"max_tickets\":8,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"id\":\"6942ba560d8996000179e3e5\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"name\":\"Teh Internet Is Serious Business\",\"about\":{\"description\":\"WE ARE ANONYMOUS.\\n\\nWE ARE LEGION.\\n\\nWE DO NOT FORGIVE.\\n\\nWE DO NOT FORGET.\\n\\nEXPECT US.\\n\\nA 16-year-old London schoolboy and an 18-year-old recluse in Shetland meet online, pick a fight with the FBI and change the world forever.\\n\\nTim Price gets behind the code with the original Anonymous members and creates an anarchic retelling of the birth of hacktivism. A fictional account of the true story of Anonymous and LulzSec, the collective swarm who took on the most powerful capitalist forces from their bedrooms.\\n\\nAge guidance 15+\\n\\nContent warning: This play is reflecting the language and ideologies used on the internet. It includes offensive language (including sexist, racist, homophobic) and imagery throughout. This play explores themes of the dark web, extremism, censorship, trolling and misogyny.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 15+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"new\":false,\"donation\":null,\"perm_name\":\"ryar6w-teh-internet-is-serious-business-5th-feb-the-brit-theatre-the-brit-school-london-tickets\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":1},\"score\":0,\"event_tag\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"theatre\",\"value\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}]},{\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Party with Ginger.\",\"properties\":[],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":5557},\"marketeers\":[],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-03-21/99c997cd-f9e7-45f9-83fd-1e42b19b930b.jpg?rect=1313%2C0%2C3375%2C3375\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-03-21/99c997cd-f9e7-45f9-83fd-1e42b19b930b.jpg?rect=188%2C0%2C5625%2C3375\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-03-21/99c997cd-f9e7-45f9-83fd-1e42b19b930b.jpg?rect=2072%2C0%2C1856%2C3375\"},\"announcement_date_unix\":1733436900,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"faqs\":[],\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2024-12-05T22:15:00+00:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-02-07T13:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2024-12-05T22:15:00+00:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-02-07T13:00:00+00:00\",\"event_end_date\":\"2026-02-07T16:00:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false,\"pre_sale_start_date\":null},\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"14767\",\"name\":\"Party with Ginger\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"party-with-ginger-3oogv\",\"profile_active\":false},\"unicorn\":true,\"date_unix\":1770469200,\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"offers_extras\":false,\"impression_id\":\"36a2bd84eebc2f97:20\",\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"secondary_status\":null,\"streaming_options\":null,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"14139\",\"name\":\"Balls Brothers Austin Friars\",\"address\":\"10-11 Austin Friars, City of London, London, EC2N 2HG, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.51571,\"lng\":-0.08527},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"accuracy\":12,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"balls-brothers-austin-friars-mxb5v\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-02-07T13:00:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"previews\":[],\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Qf224e15f4fd?dice_id=Qf224e15f4fd\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Kb018ffb1ee1?dice_id=Kb018ffb1ee1\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/wb87f5d5d8fd?dice_id=wb87f5d5d8fd\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Oae4ba71c744?dice_id=Oae4ba71c744\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ce360d1929cf?dice_id=ce360d1929cf\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/s9448cb53b01?dice_id=s9448cb53b01\"},\"max_tickets\":104,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"id\":\"6956681d8998850001f70359\",\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"name\":\"Ginger's Big Drag Bottomless Brunch \",\"about\":{\"description\":\"Darling, are you searching for a drag brunch like no other? Are you craving an afternoon of glittering, prosecco-fuelled, unadulterated drag fabulousness? Well, look no further than Ginger’s Big Drag Brunch– the most camp and outrageous event to grace London’s bottomless brunch scene.\\n\\nHosted by Ms Ginger Phlappage, and her squad of sassy, hilarious brunch queens \\u0026 kings, Ginger’s Big Drag Brunch brings you a boozy afternoon of drag performances, games, challenges, quizzes and plenty of audience participation, honey!\\n\\nCome prepared for free-flowing Prosecco and a scrummy two course brunch menu, with live DJs playing your favourite dance classics.\\n\\nWith a whole host of fabulous drag queens from across London and beyond performing their most gag-worthy lip-sync numbers, dance extravaganzas and side-splitting comedy skits, guests at Ginger’s Big Drag Brunch will be in for quite the show!\\n\\nVenue: Balls Brothers, Austin Friars– 5 minute walk from Liverpool Street Station.\\n\\n2 course meal and Bottomless Prosecco for 1.5 hrs\\n\\n1-4pm- doors open at 1pm, Prosecco 2pm- 4pm\\n\\nBRUNCH MAINS\\n\\nCheeseburger on a toasted bun w/ French fries Burger garnish\\n\\nAvocado on toast with poached eggs V\\n\\nFalafel \\u0026 spinach burger with vegan lime yoghurt on a toasted bun with French fries Burger garnish- V VG GF option available on request\\n\\nBRUNCH DESSERT\\n\\nVanilla Cheesecake with raspberry coulis V\\n\\nChocolate Pot with raspberry coulis VG GF DF\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"seating\":null,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"new\":false,\"donation\":null,\"perm_name\":\"6dndm2-gingers-big-drag-bottomless-brunch-7th-feb-balls-brothers-austin-friars-london-tickets\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":2},\"score\":0,\"event_tag\":null,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"theatre\",\"value\":\"culture:theatre\",\"title\":\"Theatre\"}]},{\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Party with Ginger.\",\"properties\":[],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":2003},\"marketeers\":[],\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-04-07/33faac06-3359-43e3-ac78-66689d8c9a6c.jpg?rect=1313%2C0%2C3375%2C3375\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-04-07/33faac06-3359-43e3-ac78-66689d8c9a6c.jpg?rect=188%2C0%2C5625%2C3375\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-04-07/33faa