/div></button></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-2554ecc8-5 fAoBgn\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsTopTrack__Container-sc-2c0d3cc1-3 gnQalZ\"><div class=\"EventDetailsTopTrack__Title-sc-2c0d3cc1-6 gwqOGa\"><h3>Top track</h3><div class=\"EventDetailsTopTrack__TrackTitle-sc-2c0d3cc1-4 ccdrAW\">Talking Heads - Girlfriend Is Better</div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsTopTrack__CTAWrapper-sc-2c0d3cc1-0 cnZzuM\"><audio preload=\"none\"><source src=\"https://p.scdn.co/mp3-preview/d6988795c4c56e985c276c43fd5fc957d09e5975?cid=921526b9c2da4b7b96e197790a02347e\"/></audio><button class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 EventDetailsTopTrack__CTAButton-sc-2c0d3cc1-2 kmEjJP ccUWLm eBjzPC\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M8.5 6 19 12 8.5 18V6Z\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsGotCode__Container-sc-2d693cc1-0 ebDKho\"><a>Got a code?</a></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsAbout__Container-sc-30f2e22-2 eooFSq\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"EventDetailsAbout__Text-sc-30f2e22-1 dSUZCJ\"><div class=\"TruncatedMarkdown__Wrapper-sc-30f4de94-0 cEPNdr\"><div class=\"TruncatedMarkdown__Truncated-sc-30f4de94-2 iyvFjU\"><p><em><strong>Dancing Barefoot presents: Stop Making Sense (1984)</strong></em></p>\n<p>Ahead of their first ever Byrne’s Night tour (and biggest show yet at KOKO), the crew behind London’s cult celebration of David Byrne and Robert Burns return to their original home at MOTH Club for a Sun...</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"TruncatedMarkdown__MoreButton-sc-30f4de94-1 lbefHP\">Read more</button></div></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlights-sc-d40475af-2 dXmIOz\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlight-sc-d40475af-0 dVKeAb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://w