ckham-m2dv\">Prince of Peckham</a></div><div class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Date-sc-cac69206-2 kDgXil\">Wed, 14 Jan, 7:00 pm</div><div class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Tags-sc-cac69206-4 cfoWLz\"><span class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Tag-sc-cac69206-3 hFGqZr\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"m13.5 19.5-8-8v-6h6l8 8-6 6Z\"></path><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M9 7.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 1 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0-3Z\"></path></svg><span>Film</span></span><span class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Tag-sc-cac69206-3 hFGqZr\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M10.774 18.763c.262.283.48.509.634.664.194.196.393.385.592.576.199-.19.398-.38.592-.576a30.327 30.327 0 0 0 2.557-2.957c.7-.927 1.407-1.993 1.941-3.094.532-1.095.91-2.26.91-3.376a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 1.116.378 2.28.91 3.376.534 1.101 1.242 2.167 1.94 3.094.701.928 1.4 1.727 1.924 2.293ZM12 8a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>London</span></span></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-2554ecc8-5 fAoBgn\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsCallToAction__Container-sc-fe1abec0-0 hOlIln\"><div class=\"EventDetailsCallToAction__PriceRow-sc-fe1abec0-1 bxORyQ\"><div class=\"EventDetailsCallToAction__Price-sc-fe1abec0-6 eQzmFy\"><span>Free</span><small>The price you&#x27;ll pay. No surprises later.</small></div><button disabled=\"\" loading=\"1\" class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 EventDetailsCallToAction__ActionButton-sc-fe1abec0-5 kmEjJP chuNsq cOKqDM\"><div class=\"Loader-sc-e02fc997-0 cGAjfq\"></div></button></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-2554ecc8-5 fAoBgn\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsGotCode__Container-sc-2d693