dd\"></path></svg><span>Android</span></a></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-2554ecc8-5 fAoBgn\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsFAQ__Container-sc-7130cefd-1 kjqLCB\"><p>DICE protects fans and artists from touts. Tickets will be securely stored in the app.</p></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div></div></div></div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\",\"@type\":\"ScreeningEvent\",\"url\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice.fm\\u002Fevent\\u002F3ogmgg-movie-night-white-men-cant-jump-14th-jan-prince-of-peckham-london-tickets\",\"name\":\"Movie Night: White Men cant Jump\",\"startDate\":\"2026-01-14T19:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-01-14T23:00:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FOfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FEventScheduled\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Prince of Peckham\",\"address\":\"1 Clayton Rd, Peckham, London SE15 5JA, UK\",\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":51.47358029999999,\"longitude\":-0.06533349999995153}},\"image\":[\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice-media.imgix.net\\u002Fattachments\\u002F2026-01-07\\u002Fc9d846a9-1553-4c27-a00f-555baf58e299.jpg?rect=0%2C159%2C950%2C950\"],\"description\":\"Showcasing our First Movie Night here at Prince of Peckham. We want to show you guys all some love and will be offering spaces on a first come first basis for free tickets that include a free hotdog.\\n\\nGuests will be able to order food and drinks from the comfort of your seat without needing to interrupt the film to go and queue at the bar.\\n\\nWhat are you waiting for!\",\"offers\":[],\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"The Arbuthnot Group Ltd\"}}</script></div><footer class=\"Footer__Wrapper-sc-b4b03d95-1 bXotkg default-footer-background hide-in-purchase-flow\"><div class=