us landscape of South Asia\\\\\\\" - Peter Bradshaw, The Guardian\\\\n\\\\n@dashthehengestore x SECRET CEREMONY by @lost.art.media return to St Giles' for a screening of Michael Powell and Emeric Pressburger 1947 classic BLACK NARCISSUS on JANUARY 15th 2026\\\\n\\\\nAs always the night will commence with a live musical performance by experimental artists chl0ecurry+tomirose\\\\n\\\\nOur previous events have all SOLD OUT so don't delay, grab your tickets while you can!\\\\n\\\\nArt by @kieranrid\\\\n\\\\nSound as always by @evareadypa and @liveatstgiles\\\\n\\\\nFull Peter Bradshaw review https://www.theguardian.com/theguardian/2005/aug/05/3\\\\n\\\\n\\\\\\\\--\\\\n\\\\nA percentage of every ticket sold will be contributed to The Friends of St Giles’\\\\n\\\\nThe Friends of St Giles’ was founded in the 1980’s to help raise funds for the repair and maintenance of St Giles.\\\\n\\\\nIt recognises that St Giles’ plays a significant role in the secular life of SE5, in particular through the development of community involvement in music and the arts.\\\",\\\"highlights\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"age_restriction\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"This is an 18+ event\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"external_link\\\":null},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"promoter\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Presented by Dash The Henge Store x Secret Ceremony by LOST ART\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"external_link\\\":null}]},\\\"id\\\":\\\"690a239343748b00013df229\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Black Narcissus: Film Screening \\u0026 chl0ecurry+tomirose Live\\\",\\\"summary_lineup\\\":{\\\"top_artists\\\":[],\\\"total_artists\\\":0,\\\"total_free_texts\\\":2},\\\"marketeers\\\":[],\\\"max_tickets\\\":6,\\\"attendance_type\\\":\\\"live_only\\\",\\\"is_hidden_event\\\":false},\\\"queryParams\\\":{},\\\"eventLoading\\\":false,\\\"ticketTypesLoading\\\":false},\\\"events\\\":{\\\"homeCityTopEventsLoading\\\":false},\\\"purchase\\\":{\\\"productType\\\":\\\"ticket\\\",\\\"cart\\\":{\\\"items\\\":[]},\\\"ticketTypeId\\\":1146666,\\\"ticketsIncr