\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"m13.5 19.5-8-8v-6h6l8 8-6 6Z\"></path><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M9 7.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 1 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0-3Z\"></path></svg><span>Film</span></span><span class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Tag-sc-cac69206-3 hFGqZr\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M10.774 18.763c.262.283.48.509.634.664.194.196.393.385.592.576.199-.19.398-.38.592-.576a30.327 30.327 0 0 0 2.557-2.957c.7-.927 1.407-1.993 1.941-3.094.532-1.095.91-2.26.91-3.376a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 1.116.378 2.28.91 3.376.534 1.101 1.242 2.167 1.94 3.094.701.928 1.4 1.727 1.924 2.293ZM12 8a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>London</span></span></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-2554ecc8-5 fAoBgn\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsCallToAction__Container-sc-fe1abec0-0 hOlIln\"><div class=\"EventDetailsCallToAction__PriceRow-sc-fe1abec0-1 bxORyQ\"><div class=\"EventDetailsCallToAction__Price-sc-fe1abec0-6 eQzmFy\"><span>From £19</span><small>The price you&#x27;ll pay. No surprises later.</small></div><button disabled=\"\" loading=\"1\" class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 EventDetailsCallToAction__ActionButton-sc-fe1abec0-5 kmEjJP chuNsq cOKqDM\"><div class=\"Loader-sc-e02fc997-0 cGAjfq\"></div></button></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-2554ecc8-5 fAoBgn\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsGotCode__Container-sc-2d693cc1-0 ebDKho\"><a>Got a code?</a></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsAbout__Container-sc-30f2e22-2 eooFSq\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"EventDetailsAbout__Text-sc-30f2e22-1 dSUZCJ\"><div class=\"TruncatedMarkdown__Wrapper-sc-30f4de94-0 cEPNdr\"><div class=\"TruncatedMarkdown__Truncated-sc-30f4de94-2 iyvFjU\"><p><strong>Enjoy High School Musical 3 as we bring this cult classic back for one day only, on Sat 17th January 2026 🌟</strong></p>\n<p>They went viral on TikTok last year and over 4,500 Disney Channel lovers have already come to party with us before… So, gather your fellow Wild Ca...</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"TruncatedMarkdown__MoreButton-sc-30f4de94-1 lbefHP\">Read more</button></div></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlights-sc-d40475af-2 dXmIOz\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlight-sc-d40475af-0 dVKeAb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M10.5 10.5H12v5m-1.5 0H12m0 0h1.5m-1.5-7V8m7.5 4a7.5 7.5 0 1 1-15 0 7.5 7.5 0 0 1 15 0Z\"></path></svg><div><span>This is an 18+ event</span><small></small></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlight-sc-d40475af-0 dVKeAb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M8.5 14.5h-3v-5h5m-2 5v4m0-4h2m0 0 7 4v-13l-7 4m0 5v-5m9 1v3\"></path></svg><div><span>Presented by The Clapham Grand.</span><small></small></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlight-sc-d40475af-0 EventDetailsBase__RefundPolicyHighlight-sc-d40475af-1 dVKeAb hDpyKl\"><div class=\"EventDetailsAbout__CurrencyIconWrapper-sc-30f2e22-0 kzRnMR\"><div class=\"CurrencyIcon__Currency-sc-8c04e303-0 jMba-DY\">£</div></div><div data-nosnippet=\"true\"><span>You can <a href=\"https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409603669777\" target=\"_blank\">get a refund</a> if:</span><ul><li>It’s within 24 hours of buying tickets</li><li>This event is rescheduled or cancelled</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlight-sc-d40475af-0 dVKeAb\">You can&#x27;t get a refund within 24 hours of the event start time.</div></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsVenue__Con