in your city, with tailored recommendations synced to your music library.</p></div><div class=\"DownloadTheApp__Feature-sc-b39de8c0-4 kONEbp\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 18.5c-3.545-3-6.5-5.4-6.5-8.4 0-1.988 1.587-3.6 3.545-3.6 1.234 0 2.32.64 2.955 1.61a3.529 3.529 0 0 1 2.954-1.61c1.959 0 3.546 1.612 3.546 3.6 0 3-2.954 5.4-6.5 8.4Z\"></path></svg><p class=\"DownloadTheApp__FeatureText-sc-b39de8c0-5 edRuhS\">Keep track of what’s coming up by saving events, sharing them with friends, or even listening to new music in the app.</p></div><div class=\"DownloadTheApp__Feature-sc-b39de8c0-4 kONEbp\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M17.5 19.5v.5h.5v-.5h-.5Zm-11-15V4H6v.5h.5Zm0 15H6v.5h.5v-.5Zm2-8.5H9v-1h-.5v1Zm9.5.5V11h-1v.5h1Zm-8.45-7 .49-.1-.081-.4H9.55v.5Zm0 15v.5h.409l.081-.4-.49-.1Zm4.9 0-.49.1.081.4h.409v-.5Zm4.05-15h.5V4h-.5v.5Zm-4-.5H14v1h.5V4ZM18 8.5V9h1v-.5h-1Zm-3.854-.354-.353.354.707.707.354-.353-.708-.708ZM11 6.292l.2-.458-.2.458ZM6 4.5v6h1v-6H6Zm0 6v9h1v-9H6Zm.5.5h2v-1h-2v1Zm3.05-7H6.5v1h3.05V4Zm.49 15.6A2 2 0 0 1 12 18v-1a3 3 0 0 0-2.94 2.4l.98.2ZM6.5 20h3.05v-1H6.5v1Zm5.5-2a2 2 0 0 1 1.96 1.6l.98-.2A3 3 0 0 0 12 17v1Zm2.45 2h3.05v-1h-3.05v1ZM18.5 4h-4v1h4V4Zm-.5.5v4h1v-4h-1Zm.146-.354-4 4 .708.708 4-4-.708-.708ZM12 6c-.285 0-.556-.06-.8-.166l-.4.916c.368.161.774.25 1.2.25V6Zm-.8-.166A2.005 2.005 0 0 1 10.04 4.4l-.98.198A3.004 3.004 0 0 0 10.8 6.75l.4-.916ZM18 19.5v-8h-1v8h1Z\"></path></svg><p class=\"DownloadTheApp__FeatureText-sc-b39de8c0-5 edRuhS\">We’ve made it easy to swap your ticket with a friend, or get a refund to a sold-out show. No stress.</p></div></div><div class=\"DownloadTheAppButtons__Buttons-sc-7487b594-0 ezoNRz\"><a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/app/id898358948\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 DownloadTheAppButtons__DownloadSpecific-sc-7487b594-3 kmEjJP heaINX gvlyjj\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M15.91 2s-1.794.008-3.082 1.566h.001c-1.147 1.386-.855 2.572-.855 2.572s1.556.248 2.922-1.26C16.176 3.466 15.91 2 15.91 2Zm-2.745 4.88c-.422.156-.768.284-1.028.284-.324 0-.715-.138-1.169-.298-.63-.222-1.38-.487-2.243-.487C6.439 6.379 4 8.255 4 11.835 4 15.474 6.879 20 9.16 20c.354 0 .793-.146 1.28-.308.606-.2 1.286-.427 1.969-.427.611 0 1.142.182 1.666.362.51.175 1.014.347 1.58.347 2.496 0 4.345-4.772 4.345-4.772s-2.643-.94-2.643-3.662c0-2.416 2.122-3.412 2.122-3.412s-1.086-1.8-3.846-1.8c-.975 0-1.813.31-2.468.552Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>iOS</span></a><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=fm.dice\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 DownloadTheAppButtons__DownloadSpecific-sc-7487b594-3 kmEjJP heaINX eZhFUz\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M4 11a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v4a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-4ZM18 11a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v4a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-4ZM7 10h10v7a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1v2a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-2h-2v2a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-2H8a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-7Z\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.776 2.553a.5.5 0 0 1 .671.223l.775 1.55A4.99 4.99 0 0 1 12 4a4.99 4.99 0 0 1 1.778.325l.775-1.549a.5.5 0 1 1 .894.448l-.775 1.55A4.996 4.996 0 0 1 17 9H7c0-1.779.929-3.34 2.328-4.227l-.775-1.55a.5.5 0 0 1 .223-.67ZM10 6.5a.5.5 0 1 1-1 0 .5.5 0 0 1 1 0Zm4.5.5a.5.5 0 1 0 0-1 .5.5 0 0 0 0 1Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>Android</span></a></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-2554ecc8-5 fAoBgn\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsFAQ__Container-sc-7130cefd-1 kjqLCB\"><p>DICE protects fans and artists from touts. Tickets will be securely stored in the app.</p></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div></div></div></div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\",\"@type\":\"ScreeningEvent\",\"url\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice.fm\\u002Fevent\\u002Fq27ewy-the-traitors-season-4-final-watch-party-23rd-jan-jujus-bar-stage-london-tickets\",\"name\":\"The Traitors: Season 4 Final Watch Party\",\"startDate\":\"2026-01-23T18:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-01-23T23:00:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FOfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FEventScheduled\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"JuJu's Bar & Stage\",\"address\":\"Ely's Yard, 15 Hanbury St, London E1 6QR, UK\",\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":51.52051280000001,\"longitude\":-0.0736106}},\"image\":[\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice-media.imgix.net\\u002Fattachments\\u002F2026-01-08\\u002F90fb7221-0eec-42a6-af22-cdd5e59dea26.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\"],\"description\":\"Whether you're more of a devoted faithful or a treacherous traitor - join us for the final episode where we'll be showing the climax to Season 4 on our giant screen!\\n\\nFeaturing:\\n\\n\\\\- Guaranteed seats with our 'not' round tables and sofas\\n\\n\\\\- Themed cocktails: Faithful Fancys & Traitors Tipples\\n\\n\\\\- Win a 'shield' to be protected from buying drinks!\\n\\n\\\\- Pre-show Traitors Quiz!\\n\\n\\\\- Our annual Claudia Winkleman lookalike contest\\n\\n\\\\- Post-final viewing of 'Uncloaked'\\n\\n\\\\- 'Happy Month' special drinks prices 'til 7pm\\n\\n\\\\---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n\\nPart of a large group or have your birthday on the week of the event? Please email info@jujusbarandstage.com at least 48 hours before the event date and we'll make it a special one!\\n\\n\\\\---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n\\n(please note that this is a fan run event and not endorsed by the BBC, Studio Lambert, All3media or any other rights holders)\\n\\nThis event is for over 18's only, please bring valid ID.\\n\\nJuju's celebrates diversity, culture and excellence in the arts and entertainment and echoes this by providing a space to encourage equality, diversity and inclusion within our venue, and creating an environment free from unlawful discrimination.\",\"offers\":[],\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Juju's Bar & Stage\"}}</script></div><footer class=\"Footer__Wrapper-sc-b4b03d95-1 bXotkg default-footer-background hide-in-purchase-flow\"><div class=\"Footer__MaxWidthWrapper-sc-b4b03d95-2 Footer__PrimaryFooter-sc-b4b03d95-3 ZGZWE btQVbq\"><div class=\"Footer__LogoCol-sc-b4b03d95-6 fGSCng\"><a aria-label=\"DICE\" href=\"/\" class=\"Footer__Logo-sc-b4b03d95-7 ebGIam\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"244\" alt=\"DICE\" src=\"/static/images/dice-fan.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></div><div class=\"Footer__Nav-sc-b4b03d95-8 kTXnAq\"><details open=\"\" class=\"FooterNavCol-sc-e5ef781b-0 jLkSXP\"><summary class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__NavTitle-sc-e5ef781b-2 irmwOP dsHsU\">Our company<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"FooterNavCol__NavIcon-sc-e5ef781b-1 iFhQbp\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg></summary><nav class=\"FooterNavCol__NavList-sc-e5ef781b-3 cFQaLH\"><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/about\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">About DICE</a></div><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/jobs\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">Careers</a></div><div cla