 prices 'til 7pm\\\\n\\\\n\\\\\\\\---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\\\n\\\\nPart of a large group or have your birthday on the week of the event? Please email info@jujusbarandstage.com at least 48 hours before the event date and we'll make it a special one!\\\\n\\\\n\\\\\\\\---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\\\n\\\\n(please note that this is a fan run event and not endorsed by the BBC, Studio Lambert, All3media or any other rights holders)\\\\n\\\\nThis event is for over 18's only, please bring valid ID.\\\\n\\\\nJuju's celebrates diversity, culture and excellence in the arts and entertainment and echoes this by providing a space to encourage equality, diversity and inclusion within our venue, and creating an environment free from unlawful discrimination.\\\",\\\"highlights\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"age_restriction\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"This is an 18+ event\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"external_link\\\":null},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"promoter\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Presented by Juju's Bar \\u0026 Stage.\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"external_link\\\":null}]},\\\"seats_io_public_key\\\":null,\\\"faqs\\\":[],\\\"images\\\":{\\\"square\\\":\\\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-08/90fb7221-0eec-42a6-af22-cdd5e59dea26.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\\\",\\\"landscape\\\":\\\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-08/90fb7221-0eec-42a6-af22-cdd5e59dea26.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\\\",\\\"portrait\\\":\\\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-01-08/90fb7221-0eec-42a6-af22-cdd5e59dea26.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\\\"},\\\"donation\\\":null,\\\"seats_io_event_id\\\":null,\\\"billing_promoter\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"10188\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Juju's Bar \\u0026 Stage\\\",\\\"image\\\":{\\\"url\\\":null},\\\"perm_name\\\":\\\"jujus-bar--stage-ybap\\\",\\\"profile_active\\\":false},\\\"date_unix\\\":1769191200,\\\"public_refund_policy\\\"