4\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M10.5 10.5H12v5m-1.5 0H12m0 0h1.5m-1.5-7V8m7.5 4a7.5 7.5 0 1 1-15 0 7.5 7.5 0 0 1 15 0Z\"></path></svg><div><span>This is an 18+ event</span><small></small></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlight-sc-d40475af-0 dVKeAb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M8.5 14.5h-3v-5h5m-2 5v4m0-4h2m0 0 7 4v-13l-7 4m0 5v-5m9 1v3\"></path></svg><div><span>Presented by Deeper Into Movies.</span><small></small></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlight-sc-d40475af-0 dVKeAb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M10.5 10.5H12v5m-1.5 0H12m0 0h1.5m-1.5-7V8m7.5 4a7.5 7.5 0 1 1-15 0 7.5 7.5 0 0 1 15 0Z\"></path></svg><div><span>No Covid-19 entry requirements</span><small></small></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlight-sc-d40475af-0 EventDetailsBase__RefundPolicyHighlight-sc-d40475af-1 dVKeAb hDpyKl\"><div class=\"EventDetailsAbout__CurrencyIconWrapper-sc-30f2e22-0 kzRnMR\"><div class=\"CurrencyIcon__Currency-sc-8c04e303-0 jMba-DY\">£</div></div><div data-nosnippet=\"true\"><span>You can <a href=\"https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409603669777\" target=\"_blank\">get a refund</a> if:</span><ul><li>It’s within 24 hours of buying tickets</li><li>This event is rescheduled or cancelled</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlight-sc-d40475af-0 dVKeAb\">You can&#x27;t get a refund within 24 hours of the event start time.</div></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsVenue__Container-sc-42637e02-3 eaTxFY\"><div class=\"EventDetailsVenue__Wrapper-sc-42637e02-4 ejLGHr\"><div class=\"EventDetailsVenue__Info-sc-42637e02-7 gvBOAI\"><h3>Venue</h3><h2>The Haggerston</h2><div cla