0475af-0 dVKeAb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10.91 6.156c0-1.467 1.22-2.656 2.727-2.656 1.506 0 2.727 1.19 2.727 2.656 0 1.467-1.221 2.657-2.727 2.657-.069 0-.137-.003-.205-.008l-.388.757a.53.53 0 0 1-.02.04l-.778 1.515a4.892 4.892 0 0 1 3.06 2.477h2.147c.302 0 .546.238.546.531L18 18.907a.538.538 0 0 1-.545.531.539.539 0 0 1-.546-.531v-4.25h-1.214c.08.341.122.697.122 1.062 0 2.64-2.198 4.781-4.909 4.781C8.198 20.5 6 18.36 6 15.719c0-2.64 2.198-4.781 4.908-4.781.07 0 .14 0 .208.004l.638-1.243-3.28-.799-1.439 2.807a.552.552 0 0 1-.731.237.525.525 0 0 1-.245-.712l1.635-3.188a.55.55 0 0 1 .62-.278l3.94.96.112-.22a2.648 2.648 0 0 1-1.456-2.35Zm2.727-1.593c-.904 0-1.636.713-1.636 1.593s.732 1.594 1.636 1.594c.903 0 1.636-.714 1.636-1.594 0-.88-.732-1.593-1.636-1.593ZM10.908 12c-2.108 0-3.817 1.665-3.817 3.719s1.709 3.719 3.817 3.719c2.109 0 3.818-1.665 3.818-3.72 0-2.053-1.71-3.718-3.818-3.718Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>Accessibility information</span></a></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div><h2 class=\"Heading-sc-f4d3e295-0 cFkXQe\">FAQs</h2><div class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Container-sc-e490eb63-4 fJyVpz\"><details class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Details-sc-e490eb63-3 hZMSuP\"><summary class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Summary-sc-e490eb63-1 a-DvNm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__StyledChevron-sc-e490eb63-2 bAcUfw\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg><span class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 irmwOP\">What do I do if I have a question about the show or venue?</span></summary><div class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Body-sc-e490eb63-0 PHKpj\"><span class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 irmwOP\"><p>Check out all FAQs for attending shows on our website, here: <a href=\"https://claphamgrand.com/faqs/\" target=\"_blank\">https://claphamgrand.com/faqs/</a></p>\n<p>For any further information about the show, timings, age restrictions or general questions please contact Team Grand on <a href=\"mailto:info@claphamgrand.com\" target=\"_blank\">info@claphamgrand.com</a> detailing your enquiry and the show/date in question and we’ll be happy to help</p></span></div></details><details class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Details-sc-e490eb63-3 hZMSuP\"><summary class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Summary-sc-e490eb63-1 a-DvNm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__StyledChevron-sc-e490eb63-2 bAcUfw\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg><span class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 irmwOP\">I have questions about access, where can I get the information I need?</span></summary><div class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Body-sc-e490eb63-0 PHKpj\"><span class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 irmwOP\"><p>You can see our venue access info here - <a href=\"https://claphamgrand.com/accessibility/\" target=\"_blank\">https://claphamgrand.com/accessibility/</a></p>\n<p>If you require PA tickets or seat reservations for access reasons please contact us prior to purchasing your tickets to ensure we have availability and can meet your requirements. The best way to do this is by calling us on 020 7223 6523 or emailing <a href=\"mailto:access@claphamgrand.com\" target=\"_blank\">access@claphamgrand.com</a> &amp; including your phone number in the email. Our office hours are 9am-5.30pm Mon – Sat</p></span></div></details><details class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Details-sc-e490eb63-3 hZMSuP\"><summary class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Summary-sc-e490eb63-1 a-DvNm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__StyledChevron-sc-e490eb63-2 bAcUfw\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg><span class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 irmwOP\">I have already purchased my tickets &amp; have questions about the tickets themselves</span></summary><div class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Body-sc-e490eb63-0 PHKpj\"><span class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 irmwOP\"><p>For any ticketing enquiries, please contact DICE via their Help Desk. If you still have questions after this, please email <a href=\"mailto:info@claphamgrand.com\" target=\"_blank\">info@claphamgrand.com</a></p></span></div></details><details class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Details-sc-e490eb63-3 hZMSuP\"><summary class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Summary-sc-e490eb63-1 a-DvNm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__StyledChevron-sc-e490eb63-2 bAcUfw\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg><span class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 irmwOP\">What is &#x27;unallocated&#x27; seating?</span></summary><div class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Body-sc-e490eb63-0 PHKpj\"><span class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 irmwOP\"><p>Most of our seated shows have unallocated seating, meaning seating is on a first come, first served basis in the area you have bought a ticket for (eg stalls/circle). We never sell more tickets than there are seats available - so if you&#x27;ve bought a ticket for a seat, you&#x27;ll definitely get a seat, you just won&#x27;t have a specific seat reserved.</p></span></div></details><details class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Details-sc-e490eb63-3 hZMSuP\"><summary class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Summary-sc-e490eb63-1 a-DvNm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__StyledChevron-sc-e490eb63-2 bAcUfw\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg><span class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 irmwOP\">Can I come back in if I leave the venue during a show or event?</span></summary><div class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Body-sc-e490eb63-0 PHKpj\"><span class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 irmwOP\"><p>Unless otherwise stated all our events have a no re-admission policy.</p></span></div></details><details class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Details-sc-e490eb63-3 hZMSuP\"><summary class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Summary-sc-e490eb63-1 a-DvNm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__StyledChevron-sc-e490eb63-2 bAcUfw\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg><span class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 irmwOP\">What can I expect in terms of flashing lights, loud noises and other similar elements?</span></summary><div class=\"EventDetailsExpandableFAQs__Body-sc-e490eb63-0 PHKpj\"><span class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 irmwOP\"><p>Please note there may be strobes, flashing lights, loud noises, confetti, the occasional balloon drop and other fun stuff used in the venue. If you have any concerns about this don’t hesitate to contact us if you need any further assistance, we want to make sure you have a safe and enjoyable experience with us</p></span></div></details></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"DownloadTheApp__Container-sc-b39de8c0-0 gmAtbP EventDetailsLayout__SEventDetailsDownloadTheApp-sc-2554ecc8-6 iWBVLc\"><div class=\"DownloadTheApp__Features-sc-b39de8c0-1 lmqFKi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 96 96\" class=\"DownloadTheApp__SDiceAppIcon-sc-b39de8c0-2 bvxMuT\"><path fil