e securely stored in the app.</p><p class=\"EventDetailsFAQ__NoSmartphone-sc-7130cefd-0 dbVqMc\">No smartphone? No worries, check our <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://dicefm.zendesk.com/hc/articles/19414143889169-How-to-access-your-tickets-if-you-can-t-get-on-the-app\">FAQs</a></p></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div></div></div></div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\",\"@type\":\"TheaterEvent\",\"url\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice.fm\\u002Fevent\\u002F6dwr77-the-mummy-movie-night-30th-jan-the-clapham-grand-london-tickets\",\"name\":\"The Mummy Movie Night\",\"startDate\":\"2026-01-30T18:30:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-01-30T22:30:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FOfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FEventScheduled\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"address\":\"The Clapham Grand, 21-25 St John's Hill, London SW11 1TT, UK\",\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":51.4629923,\"longitude\":-0.169368800000029}},\"image\":[\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice-media.imgix.net\\u002Fattachments\\u002F2025-12-01\\u002Ff5aac8b6-8756-4983-b532-b0a7ae1e1421.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\"],\"description\":\"**FRIDAY 30 JANUARY \\u002F DOORS 6.30PM \\u002F MOVIE FROM 7.30PM**\\n\\n**Oh, we've dreamt about this since we were little!**\\n\\nJoin us for the cult classic 🤩\\n\\nLook, we... We may not be explorers or adventurers, or treasure-seekers or gunfighters, but we're proud of what we are. A huge theatre with a massive screen! Featuring Evelyn & Rick costume competition, toilet paper mummifying, Blood & Sand cocktails & the movie played in full 🔥\\n\\nCome for Brendan Fraser, stay for Rachel Weisz...\\n\\nPopcorn, hot dogs & nachos served throughout 🍿\\n\\n**If you have any questions please scroll down to the FAQ section below.**\",\"offers\":[],\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\"}}</script></div><footer class=\"Footer__Wrapper-sc-b4b03d95-1 bXotkg default-footer-background hide-in-purchase-flow\"><div class=\"Footer__MaxWidthWrapper-sc-b4b03d95-2 Footer__PrimaryFooter-sc-b4b03d95-3 ZGZWE btQVbq\"><div class=\"Footer__LogoCol-sc-b4b03d95-6 fGSCng\"><a aria-label=\"DICE\" href=\"/\" class=\"Footer__Logo-sc-b4b03d95-7 ebGIam\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"244\" alt=\"DICE\" src=\"/static/images/dice-fan.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></div><div class=\"Footer__Nav-sc-b4b03d95-8 kTXnAq\"><details open=\"\" class=\"FooterNavCol-sc-e5ef781b-0 jLkSXP\"><summary class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__NavTitle-sc-e5ef781b-2 irmwOP dsHsU\">Our company<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"FooterNavCol__NavIcon-sc-e5ef781b-1 iFhQbp\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg></summary><nav class=\"FooterNavCol__NavList-sc-e5ef781b-3 cFQaLH\"><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/about\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">About DICE</a></div><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/jobs\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">Careers</a></div><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/diversity-equity-inclusion\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">Diversity, equity \n&amp; inclusion</a></div></nav></details><details open=\"\" class=\"FooterNavCol-sc-e5ef781b-0 jLkSXP\"><summary class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__NavTitle-sc-e5ef781b-2 irmwOP dsHsU\">Fan Support<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"FooterNavCol__NavIcon-sc-e5e